{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063869/block/singleImage/3267644/df/01M7F8KJ32FSV6QZVN2AF9AM1T.jpg?updatedAt=1794735104\"/><figcaption>夏寶龍在深圳聽取有關工作情況匯報。(資料圖片／政府新聞處)</figcaption></figure><p>中央港澳工作領導小組副組長、中央港澳辦主任、國務院港澳辦主任夏寶龍，今日在深圳聽取有關工作情況匯報。港澳辦分管日常工作的副主任徐啟方亦有參與。 港澳辦未有交代匯報涉及哪些事項，而去年12月1日大埔宏福苑五級火後，港澳辦亦曾發稿稱夏寶龍在深圳聽取「有關情況」匯報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:39:29.623300+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:31:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:20.126600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:33:05.133606+00:00","content_hash":"ff6733d1ef7737d108cec0abfce23513b548467abd557adf0a2fe9bf20fab566","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:39:29.623300+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}